<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; font-size:
      .9em; } .header { text-align: center; background-color: #4CAF50; padding:
      10px; color: white; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; } .content { padding:
      20px; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; } .content p {
      margin: 10px 0; } .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <div class="container">
      <p>Dear {{fullname}},</p>
      <p>To securely access your
        {{type}}
        draft, enter the OTP below in the verification page</p>
      <p style="font-weight: semibold; font-size: 1.5em;">{{otp}}</p>
      <p>If you experience any issues or do not receive your OTP, please contact
        our support team for assistance.</p>
      <p>Thank you for your prompt attention.</p>

      <div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Best regards,</div>
        <div>AXIA Human Resources Department</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>